the mut vars to the\nfields of the tuple and call `k` in the resulting local context.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.bindMutVarsFromTuple","kind":"def","line":646,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.bindMutVarsFromTuple","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L646-L676"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.MutVar.stateValue\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">MutVar</span>.<span class=\"name\">stateValue</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mv</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.MutVar\">MutVar</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The current value of `mv` as packed into runtime state. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.MutVar.stateValue","kind":"def","line":641,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.MutVar.stateValue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L641-L644"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.MutVar.stateType\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">MutVar</span>.<span class=\"name\">stateType</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mv</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.MutVar\">MutVar</a>)</span></span>\n<span cl