span>.<span class=\"name\">ContInfo</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Information about a success, `return`, `break` or `continue` continuation that will be filled in\nafter the code using it has been elaborated.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.ContInfo","kind":"structure","line":252,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.ContInfo","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L252-L260"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.instInhabitedReturnCont\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedReturnCont</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.ReturnCont\">ReturnCont</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.instInhabitedReturnCont","kind":"instance","line":250,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.instInhabitedReturnCont","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L250-L250"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.ReturnCont.k\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">ReturnCont</span>.<span class=\"name\">k</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.ReturnCont\">ReturnCont</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElabM\">DoElabM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The elaborator constructing a jump site to the return continuation,\ngiven some return value. The type of this return value determines the type of the jump expression;\nthis could very well be different than the `resultType` in case an intervening `match` has refined\n`resultType`. So `k` must *not* hardcode the type `resultType` into its definition; rather it\nshould infer the type of the return value argument.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.ReturnCont.k","kind":"def","line":249,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.ReturnCont.k","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L249-L249"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.ReturnCont.resultType\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">ReturnCont</span>.<span class=\"name\">resultType</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.ReturnCont\">ReturnCont</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.ReturnCont.resultType","kind":"def","line":241,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.ReturnCont.resultType","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L241-L241"}},{"