.Elab.Do.DoElemCont.k","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L223-L223"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont.resultType\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">DoElemCont</span>.<span class=\"name\">resultType</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont\">DoElemCont</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The type of the monadic result. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont.resultType","kind":"def","line":217,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont.resultType","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L217-L217"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont.resultName\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">DoElemCont</span>.<span class=\"name\">resultName</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont\">DoElemCont</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The name of the monadic result variable. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont.resultName","kind":"def","line":215,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont.resultName","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L215-L215"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">DoElemCont</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Lean.Expr</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElabM\">Lean.Elab.Do.DoElabM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Lean.Expr</a></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind\">Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont\">Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont</a></span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont.mk","kind":"ctor","line":190,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L190-L229"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">DoElemCont</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Elaboration of a `do` block `do $e; $rest`, results in a call\n``elabTerm `(do $e; $rest) = elabDoElem e dec``, where `elabDoElem e ·` is the elaborator for `do`\nelement `e`, and `dec` is the `DoElemCont` describing the elaboration of the rest of the block\n`rest`.\n\nIf the semantics of `e` resumes its continuation `rest`, its elaborator must bind its result to\n`resultName`, ensure that it has type `resultType` and then elaborate `rest` using `dec`.\n\nClearly, for term elements `e : m α`, the result has type `α`.\nMore subtly, for binding elements `let x := e` or `let x ← e`, the result has type `PUnit` and is\nunrelated to the type of the bound variable `x`.\n\nExamples:\n* `return` drops the continuation; `return x; pure ()` elaborates to `pure x`.\n* `let x ← e; rest x` elaborates to `e >>= fun x => rest x`.\n* `let x := 3; let y ← (let x ← e); rest x` elaborates to\n  `let x := 3; e >>= fun x_1 => let y := (); rest x`, which is immediately zeta-reduced to\n  `let x := 3; e >>= fun x_1 => rest x`.\n* `one; two` elaborates to `one >>= fun (_ : PUnit) => two`; it is an error if `one` does not have\n  type `PUnit`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont","kind":"structure","line":190,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemCont","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L190-L229"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.instInhabitedDoElemContKind\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedDoElemContKind</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind\">DoElemContKind</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.instInhabitedDoElemContKind","kind":"instance","line":188,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.instInhabitedDoElemContKind","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L188-L188"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind.duplicable\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">DoElemContKind</span>.<span class=\"name\">duplicable</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind\">DoElemContKind</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind.duplicable","kind":"ctor","line":187,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind.duplicable","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L187-L187"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind.nonDuplicable\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">DoElemContKind</span>.<span class=\"name\">nonDuplicable</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind\">DoElemContKind</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind.nonDuplicable","kind":"ctor","line":186,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind.nonDuplicable","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L186-L186"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">inductive</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">DoElemContKind</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether the continuation of a `do` element is duplicable. Saying `nonDuplicable` is always safe;\n`duplicable` allows for more optimizations.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind","kind":"inductive","line":181,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.DoElemContKind","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L181-L188"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoOpsRef.toDoOps\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">DoOpsRef</span>.<span class=\"name\">toDoOps</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">r</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoOpsRef\">DoOpsRef</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoOps\">DoOps</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoOpsRef.toDoOps","kind":"opaque","line":178,"name":"Lean.Elab.Do.DoOpsRef.toDoOps","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.lean#L178-L179"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><